<title>THAILAND: Serm Suk Plc sets 9.50 baht annual div.</title>
<headline>Serm Suk Plc sets 9.50 baht annual div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	9.50 vs N/A</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend:    April 7</p>
<p>    Payment date:   May 16, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Company's full name is Serm Suk Plc. The company is a beverage bottler and distributor.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
